199 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 65 0 R
/E (The PET recycling program has been a long-running project. The team collects used plastic bottles across campus and converts them into 1.75 mm filament for in-house 3D printing. After successfully using recycled PET to manufacture the nose cone of our 2024 competition turbine, the team is working to produce longer, more consistent filament spools, improve material strength, and expand its use across future turbine components. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
